` FLAME logsource mapping -- field names, index, and sourcetype require environment-specific tuning. `

event_type="file_create" file_extension IN ("*.zip*", "*.rar*", "*.7z*") archive_file_list IN ("*passwords*", "*Login Data*", "*Cookies*", "*autofill*", "*wallet.dat*", "*seed*", "*credit_cards*") OR (process_signed=false process_path IN ("*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp*", "*\\Users\\Public*", "*\\ProgramData*"))
